OL,3,GNEWSAWoman's 'shock' at private baby
OL,4,Ascan clinic experience
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pregnant woman has criticised her
OL,7,Fexperience at a private ultrasound
OL,8,Fclinic after being told her baby's
OL,9,Fheartbeat could not be detected at an
OL,10,Fearly scan.
OL,12,FMireia Colomer booked the appointment
OL,13,Fat Precious Glimpse Roundhay in Leeds
OL,14,Fat eight weeks, but claimed the
OL,15,Fsonographer did not examine her
OL,16,Fproperly.
OL,18,FShe was referred to the NHS for another
OL,19,Fscan days later, where staff were able
OL,20,Fto reassure her that she was still
OL,21,Fcarrying her baby.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
