OL,4,Ascan clinic experience
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer visit was just days before a Care
OL,7,FQuality Commission (CQC) inspection of
OL,8,FPrecious Glimpse which rated it
OL,9,Finadequate, citing concerns over
OL,10,Ftraining.
